{
    "word": "rockabye",
    "lang_code": "en",
    "source_file_to_entries": {
        "raw-wiktextract-data.jsonl": [
            {
                "entry_id": "bd8f8f82-90e6-3b21-aadb-f2cd38dacd54",
                "word": "rockabye",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "en",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "5d657089-2930-448f-913f-78f775988224",
                        "entry_id": "bd8f8f82-90e6-3b21-aadb-f2cd38dacd54",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "rockabyes"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "9eccace4-cdc3-3b28-bf1a-fdb9ddea544b",
                        "entry_id": "bd8f8f82-90e6-3b21-aadb-f2cd38dacd54",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A soothing rocking motion."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "2df30520-516f-4b41-9301-f6a2ef60b2b4",
                                "sense_id": "9eccace4-cdc3-3b28-bf1a-fdb9ddea544b",
                                "text": "All the lullabies of the world suggest undulatory movements or rockabyes in the tree tops."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "e741a842-b7f7-4de9-afe0-d837a64ef738",
                                "sense_id": "9eccace4-cdc3-3b28-bf1a-fdb9ddea544b",
                                "text": "This is what Eve was thinking as she listened to the dance music swinging like a rockabye hammock hung between the silky strands of[…]"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "5a7832cf-c8fa-4673-b3b9-874c9ee8359c",
                                "sense_id": "9eccace4-cdc3-3b28-bf1a-fdb9ddea544b",
                                "text": "Every forty-five minutes occurred A Laugh, selected sea-chanties were alternately mumbled and roared, and the saddest intermission orchestra I have ever heard fiddled jigs and reels to a rockabye tempo."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "9ed677a7-63e8-4e6e-befd-511ff65567ce",
                                "sense_id": "9eccace4-cdc3-3b28-bf1a-fdb9ddea544b",
                                "text": "Carruthers’ sobs have a rockabye beat."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "f112bf86-a762-433f-9040-2e220272a55c",
                                "sense_id": "9eccace4-cdc3-3b28-bf1a-fdb9ddea544b",
                                "text": "ROCKABYE HAMMOCK. Grown-ups aren’t the only ones who love the sunny laziness of a hammock, so this one has been designed for children between the ages of four and ten."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "15a0bb3b-7e07-4528-8c5d-5e7835629c74",
                                "sense_id": "9eccace4-cdc3-3b28-bf1a-fdb9ddea544b",
                                "text": "I have been a rockabye baby sloshed in the sludge of the sea and I have clung with a shell over me waiting a tide to bring me breakfast."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "119cb34f-dd93-477d-bc50-9e5d740ab3b1",
                                "sense_id": "9eccace4-cdc3-3b28-bf1a-fdb9ddea544b",
                                "text": "Then, in a rockabye vein, comes Catalina’s white two-piece suit of knit that resembles a baby’s blanket and is trimmed with pink crocheted scalloped edges and tassels wherever there is an edge to decorate."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "90fbe8b0-5319-427f-a64d-f9798c3d865d",
                                "sense_id": "9eccace4-cdc3-3b28-bf1a-fdb9ddea544b",
                                "text": "Just lie still; just don’t cry; I’ll rock you with a rockabye."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "4d654164-6343-4cd6-9254-66c9522a36ef",
                                "sense_id": "9eccace4-cdc3-3b28-bf1a-fdb9ddea544b",
                                "text": "Debbi will sit and talk for a while, then charge off to breast-feed the baby. Her office features a rockabye-baby device with a fringed top."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "6453ee02-8140-4871-ac70-2fd83ca5f9a8",
                                "sense_id": "9eccace4-cdc3-3b28-bf1a-fdb9ddea544b",
                                "text": "Linda is working her soft soft wet mouth gently against mine, letting me dream her tongue and meanwhile, below, she cups Mr. Genital in her hands and gives the triangle a firm squeeze, a rockabye side-to-side shake."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "a3c4fcba-a624-4d8a-bace-a8b477f13640",
                                "sense_id": "9eccace4-cdc3-3b28-bf1a-fdb9ddea544b",
                                "text": "So the tree house itself could’ve been a celebration of Chad’s birth—the epitome of a rockabye-baby cradle in the tree top?"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "35a73744-5cb9-47b2-90b8-2dd5a22bafd2",
                                "sense_id": "9eccace4-cdc3-3b28-bf1a-fdb9ddea544b",
                                "text": "Seed has paired us on the MetroBabe Stroller audio job, designing an interface that works for both toddlers and parents. At the touch of a button, it has to be able to play back rockabyes, current hits packaged as instrumental lullabies for baby, or MetroBabe’s private info station, simply jam-packed with useful information to help guide new parents through the very special hell they’ve signed up for."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "0cf67a08-306a-4d29-b703-85cdf4854aaa",
                                "sense_id": "9eccace4-cdc3-3b28-bf1a-fdb9ddea544b",
                                "text": "Trains and books and dolly with open eyes\n Creak and creak for Grandpa’s rockabyes"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "f0d64185-fd64-41e5-b666-9b9df3480091",
                                "sense_id": "9eccace4-cdc3-3b28-bf1a-fdb9ddea544b",
                                "text": "[…]; a Mommy’s arms to enfold with love for a rockabye time or a story;"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "ac008b51-44e7-4c2a-8dcf-d72dad5daebe",
                                "sense_id": "9eccace4-cdc3-3b28-bf1a-fdb9ddea544b",
                                "text": "The ear, our body’s innate artist, wields the hammer, tip[-]taps the anvil, turns, without trying, the monotonous slammings of water and sand into sweet rockabyes."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "1b6d7981-f4a4-4876-b896-65436b18725f",
                                "sense_id": "9eccace4-cdc3-3b28-bf1a-fdb9ddea544b",
                                "text": "In the eaves, dove coos a rockabye song."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "72cc58e6-b8a1-4c3b-8ab9-47708b4864ae",
                                "sense_id": "9eccace4-cdc3-3b28-bf1a-fdb9ddea544b",
                                "text": "Being a rockabye-baby mom was never my thing."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
